atoi(200) as CHAR = -56
abs(-300) as UCHAR = 44
labs(-40000) as SHORT = -25536
strtol(70000) as USHORT = 4464
toupper of a CHAR 353 = 65
tolower of a UCHAR 321 = 97
isalpha of a SHORT 65+65536 is true
isdigit of a USHORT 48+65536 is true
a ulong result is zero extended
a long result is sign extended
llabs of a LLONG
a llong result
a ullong result is the whole word
rand() takes no argument
srand and rand are repeatable
